    {
      "id": "dom-ce90c19a",
      "text": "Hub 与 Agent 支持 x86_64、ARM64 的 GNU 和 musl Linux 工件。Debian 使用 systemd，Alpine 使用 OpenRC。",
      "kind": "text",
      "channel": "text",
      "location": "main#main > p.doc-lead:nth-of-type(2)",
      "visibility": "visible",
      "attribute": null,
      "reference": null,
      "jsonPath": null,
      "redacted": false
    },
    {
      "id": "dom-57da7520",
      "text": "安装前",
      "kind": "text",
      "channel": "text",
      "location": "main#main > div.notice > strong",
      "visibility": "visible",
      "attribute": null,
      "reference": null,
      "jsonPath": null,
      "redacted": false
    },
    {
      "id": "dom-7d711a49",
      "text": "从已发布的归档获取工件，先验证来源证明与 SHA-256，再解压和安装。不要从可变的 master 分支直接执行安装脚本。",
      "kind": "text",
      "channel": "text",
      "location": "main#main > div.notice > p",
      "visibility": "visible",
      "attribute": null,
      "reference": null,
      "jsonPath": null,
      "redacted": false
    },
    {
      "id": "dom-88f64ccb",
      "text": "选择工件",
      "kind": "text",
      "channel": "text",
      "location": "h2#choose",
      "visibility": "visible",
      "attribute": null,
      "reference": null,
      "jsonPath": null,
      "redacted": false
    },
    {
      "id": "dom-92aca975",
      "text": "根据主机架构和 libc 选择对应的 Hub 归档。Agent 可以原生运行；Agent Docker 镜像按 x86_64 和 ARM64 分发。Hub Docker 不在当前支持范围。",
      "kind": "text",
      "channel": "text",
      "location": "main#main > p:nth-of-type(3)",
      "visibility": "visible",
      "attribute": null,
      "reference": null,
      "jsonPath": null,
      "redacted": false
    },
    {
      "id": "dom-3ad31f44",
      "text": "验证并安装 Hub",
      "kind": "text",
      "channel": "text",
      "location": "h2#verify",
      "visibility": "visible",
      "attribute": null,
      "reference": null,
      "jsonPath": null,
      "redacted": false
    },
    {
      "id": "dom-1786539a",
      "text": "发布归档中包含目标平台的 Hub、Agent、安装器和校验信息。验证完成后，将归档解压到空目录，并从解压目录运行安装器：",
      "kind": "text",
      "channel": "text",
      "location": "main#main > p:nth-of-type(4)",
      "visibility": "visible",
      "attribute": null,
      "reference": null,
      "jsonPath": null,
      "redacted": false
    },
    {
      "id": "dom-b7465934",
      "text": "mkdir romi-hub tar -xzf romi-hub-vX.Y.Z-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz -C romi-hub sudo sh romi-hub/deploy/hub/install.sh --site https://hub.example.com",
      "kind": "text",
      "channel": "text",
      "location": "main#main > pre > code",
      "visibility": "visible",
      "attribute": null,
      "reference": null,
      "jsonPath": null,
      "redacted": false
    },
    {
      "id": "dom-8316e977",
      "text": "Hub 监听回环地址，外部 HTTPS 由可信反向代理提供。安装器不会下载源代码或二进制。",
      "kind": "text",
      "channel": "text",
      "location": "main#main > p:nth-of-type(5)",
      "visibility": "visible",
      "attribute": null,
      "reference": null,
      "jsonPath": null,
      "redacted": false
    },
    {
      "id": "dom-4e1dcbfb",
      "text": "首次登录与节点接入",
      "kind": "text",
      "channel": "text",
      "location": "h2#bootstrap",
      "visibility": "visible",
      "attribute": null,
      "reference": null,
      "jsonPath": null,
      "redacted": false
    },
    {
      "id": "dom-0c050ce6",
      "text": "全新数据库的管理员初始密码写入",
      "kind": "text",
      "channel": "text",
      "location": "main#main > p:nth-of-type(6)",
      "visibility": "visible",
      "attribute": null,
      "reference": null,
      "jsonPath": null,
      "redacted": false
    },
    {
      "id": "dom-2b0c018f",
      "text": "/var/lib/romi/bootstrap-password",
      "kind": "text",
      "channel": "text",
      "location": "main#main > p:nth-of-type(6) > code",
      "visibility": "visible",
      "attribute": null,
      "reference": null,
      "jsonPath": null,
      "redacted": false
    },
    {
      "id": "dom-3e40705a",
      "text": "，权限为 0600。修改密码后该文件会删除。",
      "kind": "text",
      "channel": "text",
      "location": "main#main > p:nth-of-type(6)",
      "visibility": "visible",
      "attribute": null,
      "reference": null,
      "jsonPath": null,
      "redacted": false
    },
    {
      "id": "dom-0570521f",
      "text": "管理员创建节点后，由节点从可信 Hub 获取精确版本的 Agent。下载内容会按大小、SHA-256 和 Agent 版本核验。",
      "kind": "text",
      "channel": "text",
      "location": "main#main > p:nth-of-type(7)",
      "visibility": "visible",
      "attribute": null,
      "reference": null,
      "jsonPath": null,
      "redacted": false
    },
